<title>ESTONIA: TALLINN PORT TO ISSUE NEW CPS.</title>
<headline>TALLINN PORT TO ISSUE NEW CPS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinn Port (Tallinna Sadam) will issue 50 million kroons in commercial papers on June 13, Hansapank said on Monday.</p>
<p>The three-month commercial papers have a yield of 7.5 percent, Ulo Kallas, Hansapank's interest products manager, told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 6 209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
